{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c5b8be254b828d04","type":"text","text":"Lead","x":-1355,"y":-555,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a2c2a7eade1de1c9","type":"text","text":"What is that you sell ?\n\nIs it a group company or individual entity ?\n\nDo you have system in place to perform all below ?\n\nMarketing and Campaign Management\nLead Management\nPre Sales Management\nSales Management\nPost Sales - CRM\nOrder management\nStock Management\nWarehouse Management\nProduction Management\nProcurement Management\nMaintenance Management\nAsset Management\nFinance Management\nTicket Management/Help Desk\n\n\n- I am an on ERP\n- I am on Excel Sheet\n- I am on Partial ERP\n\t- sakjflkasjf\n\n\n- Can you explain pain points in each modules ?\n\t- We present our Standard Flows\n\t\t- They can comment that they want step and 4 and 5 .\n- The system you are using, does it give you integrated ERP ?\n- Does your existing system give you right, accurate analaytics ?\n- Does it give your real time analytics ?\n- ","x":-1150,"y":-430,"width":665,"height":1060},
